OL,3,GNEWSAEx-prisoner admits killing
OL,4,A'beloved grandad' in hit-and-run crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ex-prisoner has admitted killing a
OL,7,F70-year-old grandfather in a drunken
OL,8,Fhit-and-run crash in Hamilton.
OL,10,FGary Gallacher, 37, was using a mobile
OL,11,Fphone when he hit James Craig on Quarry
OL,12,FStreet in the South Lanakshire town.
OL,14,FThe High Court in Glasgow heard that
OL,15,FGallacher - who had convictions for
OL,16,Fkidnap and dangerous driving - told
OL,17,Fpassengers he could not stop his hired
OL,18,FMercedes as he was "on the run" from
OL,19,Fpolice.
OL,21,FFather-of-three Craig died at the scene
OL,22,Fon 27 October 2024.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
